🔌 API Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/incidents	Create new incident
GET	/api/incidents	List all incidents
POST	/api/investigations/start	Start investigation
GET	/api/investigations/{id}	Get investigation status
WS	/ws/investigations/{id}	Live workflow stream
POST	/api/interviews/{id}/message	Send interview message
GET	/api/graph/{incident_id}	Get knowledge graph
GET	/api/reports/{id}	Get final report
POST	/api/documents/upload	Upload policy document
Full API docs: http://localhost:8000/docs

🧪 Testing
bash
cd backend
pytest tests/ -v

cd frontend
npm run test
