[LICENSE](LICENSE)	Actual LICENSE file banana
🎯 PART 3: Extra Files Jo README Ke Saath Chahiye
README ke saath ye 3 files bhi banao (GitHub suggestion karta hai):

1. LICENSE file (root mein)
MIT License — standard hai.

2. .gitignore file (root mein)
text
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/
*.db
.env

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Chroma
data/chroma_db/
3. .env.example (backend folder mein)
env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./compliance.db
CHROMA_DB_PATH=./data/chroma_db
🚀 Ab Kya Karo?
✅ README.md file bana ke root mein paste karo

✅ LICENSE, .gitignore, .env.example bhi banao

✅ Git pe push karo:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "docs: add professional README"
git push
✅ GitHub pe refresh karo — README render hota dikhega with badges, diagrams, everything! 🎉

Bhai ab bata:

README pasand aaya? ✅

Agla step kya chahiye? — Backend main.py? DB models? RAG module? Ya frontend setup?

Bolo, main next file ka complete working code deta hoon 🚀

gigitnore file
📄 Complete .gitignore File for ai-compliance-investigator
Bhai, ye production-grade .gitignore hai jo Python (backend) + Node (frontend) + AI-specific files sab cover karta hai. Copy karke apne project ke root folder mein .gitignore naam se file banao aur paste kar do.

📥 Copy-Paste This .gitignore:
gitignore
# ============================================
# AI Compliance Investigator - .gitignore
# ============================================

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🐍 Python / Backend
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual Environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.venv*/
pythonenv*/

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Unit test / coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*

# IPython
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
.python-version

# Celery
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

# SageMath
*.sage.py

# mypy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

# Pyre type checker
.pyre/

# pytype
.pytype/

# Cython
cython_debug/

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🟩 Node.js / Frontend
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
*.local

# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Cache
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔐 Environment Variables (CRITICAL!)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.*.local
*.env

# Keep example file (this one SHOULD be committed)
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🗄️ Database Files
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
compliance.db
db/compliance.db

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🧠 AI / ML / Vector DB Specific
# ────────────────────────────────────────────

# ChromaDB
chroma_db/
chroma.sqlite3
.data/
data/chroma_db/
backend/data/chroma_db/

# FAISS
*.faiss
*.index
*.pkl

# Model weights (if any)
models/
weights/
*.h5
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin

# HuggingFace cache
.cache/huggingface/
huggingface/

# Embeddings cache
embeddings/
*.embedding
*.emb

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📁 Uploaded / User Data
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
backend/data/uploads/
backend/data/documents/
uploads/
media/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.csv

# But keep sample data (important!)
!samples/**
!backend/data/documents/**/*.md
!backend/data/documents/**/*.txt

# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📄 Generated Reports
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
reports/
*.report
generated_reports/
backend/reports


