🚀 Ab Kya Karo?
✅ README.md file bana ke root mein paste karo

✅ LICENSE, .gitignore, .env.example bhi banao

✅ Git pe push karo:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "docs: add professional README"
git push
✅ GitHub pe refresh karo — README render hota dikhega with badges, diagrams, everything! 🎉

Bhai ab bata:

README pasand aaya? ✅

Agla step kya chahiye? — Backend main.py? DB models? RAG module? Ya frontend setup?

Bolo, main next file ka complete working code deta hoon 🚀

gigitnore file
📄 Complete .gitignore File for ai-compliance-investigator
Bhai, ye production-grade .gitignore hai jo Python (backend) + Node (frontend) + AI-specific files sab cover karta hai. Copy karke apne project ke root folder mein .gitignore naam se file banao aur paste kar do.

📥 Copy-Paste This .gitignore:
