✅ 1. Badges at Top
Professional lagna, tech stack instantly dikh jata hai. Recruiters 3 second mein samajh jaate hain tumhare skills.

✅ 2. ASCII Architecture Diagram
GitHub pe bina image ke bhi architecture visualize ho jata hai. Ye ek strong signal hai ki tum system design samajhte ho.

✅ 3. "Why This Project?" Section
Ye problem statement dikhata hai. Interviewer ko clear hota hai ki tumne sirf code nahi, solution thinking bhi ki hai.

✅ 4. Multi-Agent Diagram
Ye tumhare project ka USP hai. Agentic AI is the hottest trend right now, aur ye diagram instantly dikhata hai.

✅ 5. Feature List with Emojis
Scannable hai — recruiter 10 second mein pura feature set padh lega.

✅ 6. Project Structure
Ye dikhata hai ki tumne properly organize kiya hai — production-ready mindset.

✅ 7. Quick Start with Copy-Paste Commands
Interviewer khud clone karke chala sakta hai. Ye huge plus hai.

✅ 8. Screenshots Placeholder
Baad mein tum actual screenshots dalke replace karna. Ye proof of work hai.

✅ 9. API Endpoints Table
Ye dikhata hai ki tumne REST API design kiya hai — backend skills ka proof.

✅ 10. "What I Learned" Section
Ye interview-friendly hai. Recruiter dekhta hai ki tumne actually kuch seekha hai.

✅ 11. Roadmap
Ye dikhata hai ki tumne future vision rakha hai — senior engineer trait.

